[{"Name":"Gurman Deep","ProfilePicture":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX93a3X83RZyRp3tNZxwGkKCV3Xsmi_lvN2Jn2lLL8vlK3G44x7=s120-c-rp-mo-br100","Rating":5,"Description":"To summarize in nutshell, we have appointed Arrow Point to conduct one of our critical market research study by switching from another service provider as we were facing huge setback on data quality with our earlier service provider. From our experience shall find the following Pros and Cons dealing with Arrow Point;
A) Pros: Easy and flexible to communicate as there are no multiple internal divisions and departments, easy to understand simplified scope of work proposal and research reports, quick and prompt response (once the project is agreed upon), slightly expensive but trust me if you want your project to get delivered hassle free - Arrow Point would be the right choice considering our experience with other research service providers in the past, professionalism in adhering project management schedule as their project management team is well trained, wide range of research tool access, complete dedication to projects that they’ve committed to, ethical, sincere, honest and passionate on their work, following a deep value system which is routed and shown in their every approach and reflects through-out the process.
B) Cons: Traditional approach in communicating and managing clients which might not suit new age start-up culture, no quick response until they accept our project lead, our e-mails would go vein until we reach them over a phone call, poor pre-sales, marketing and business development, slightly expensive but trust me if you want your project to get delivered hassle free Arrow Point would be the right choice considering our experience with other research service providers in the past.","Images":null,"When":"4 months ago","review_id":"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25KYU1HNVBjbE5mUkZoU0xYZDFSVU0yWXpsbWRFRRAB","source":"Google","rating_scale":5,"rating_float":5,"author_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115826682546303841434/reviews?hl=en-GB","posted_at_unix_micros":1778441155530117,"updated_at_unix_micros":1778441155530117,"language":"en","translated_lang":"","text_original":"To summarize in nutshell, we have appointed Arrow Point to conduct one of our critical market research study by switching from another service provider as we were facing huge setback on data quality with our earlier service provider. From our experience shall find the following Pros and Cons dealing with Arrow Point;
A) Pros: Easy and flexible to communicate as there are no multiple internal divisions and departments, easy to understand simplified scope of work proposal and research reports, quick and prompt response (once the project is agreed upon), slightly expensive but trust me if you want your project to get delivered hassle free - Arrow Point would be the right choice considering our experience with other research service providers in the past, professionalism in adhering project management schedule as their project management team is well trained, wide range of research tool access, complete dedication to projects that they’ve committed to, ethical, sincere, honest and passionate on their work, following a deep value system which is routed and shown in their every approach and reflects through-out the process.
B) Cons: Traditional approach in communicating and managing clients which might not suit new age start-up culture, no quick response until they accept our project lead, our e-mails would go vein until we reach them over a phone call, poor pre-sales, marketing and business development, slightly expensive but trust me if you want your project to get delivered hassle free Arrow Point would be the right choice considering our experience with other research service providers in the past.","text_translated":"","published_at":"2026-05-10T19:25:55.530117Z"},{"Name":"Jaskaran Singh","ProfilePicture":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXu_j7GE2aNNCUSl9WRbXjCucy5dTzcalm6cyBNxj8RbkNy_wYb=s120-c-rp-mo-br100","Rating":4,"Description":"We have subscribed to the marketing advisory services of Arrow Point by fixing paid consultation appointments with Mr Athesh Ravi, every session we subscribe too were highly rewarding as we could able do course correction on our marketing activities time to time and implemented necessary changes in our business, marketing, sales and brand communication strategies which fetched us positive revenue returns be it bottom line or top line. I would endorse Arrow Point for improving businesses with increased returns. We would recommend to appoint them under a long-term business or marketing advisory service contract (six months or one year) rather subscribing to short-term business consulting sessions.","Images":null,"When":"4 months ago","review_id":"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2paMFVXTXdXR2hXY2xKM2ExOVBaV3hFUjNOeldXYxAB","source":"Google","rating_scale":5,"rating_float":4,"author_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117611398989781265091/reviews?hl=en-GB","posted_at_unix_micros":1778576559114899,"updated_at_unix_micros":1778576559114899,"language":"en","translated_lang":"","text_original":"We have subscribed to the marketing advisory services of Arrow Point by fixing paid consultation appointments with Mr Athesh Ravi, every session we subscribe too were highly rewarding as we could able do course correction on our marketing activities time to time and implemented necessary changes in our business, marketing, sales and brand communication strategies which fetched us positive revenue returns be it bottom line or top line. I would endorse Arrow Point for improving businesses with increased returns. We would recommend to appoint them under a long-term business or marketing advisory service contract (six months or one year) rather subscribing to short-term business consulting sessions.","text_translated":"","published_at":"2026-05-12T09:02:39.114899Z"},{"Name":"Mr Sihu","ProfilePicture":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocL9zbudaK1yhfrRyEgm0KViUBipvzkaymzaSJEIGLQrzrQXqw=s120-c-rp-mo-br100","Rating":4,"Description":"I had such a great experience coming to Arrow Point Market Research and Insights Solutions.  The personal attention I received from Arrow Point was second to none. I felt completely taken care of from the moment I made the first inquiry about the study. Every aspect of the study was handled with care at Arrow Point — the recruiting was great, the staff friendly and attentive, and the new facility they have arranged for our Focus Group Discussions is absolutely beautiful. My client commented that it was the “nicest facility” she’d ever been in — with so many personal touches. Mumbai, Delhi, Chennai and Bangalore are the GREAT markets to consider when focusing for a product launch in India for qualitative and quantitative research, and Arrow Point is the place to go without any doubt!","Images":null,"When":"4 months ago","review_id":"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21SWWNYUjVVRkoyT0ZsbVZIRkllVU5QUVhGcVMyYxAB","source":"Google","rating_scale":5,"rating_float":4,"author_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114334838783325652669/reviews?hl=en-GB","posted_at_unix_micros":1781036011839178,"updated_at_unix_micros":1781036011839178,"language":"en","translated_lang":"","text_original":"I had such a great experience coming to Arrow Point Market Research and Insights Solutions.  The personal attention I received from Arrow Point was second to none. I felt completely taken care of from the moment I made the first inquiry about the study. Every aspect of the study was handled with care at Arrow Point — the recruiting was great, the staff friendly and attentive, and the new facility they have arranged for our Focus Group Discussions is absolutely beautiful. My client commented that it was the “nicest facility” she’d ever been in — with so many personal touches. Mumbai, Delhi, Chennai and Bangalore are the GREAT markets to consider when focusing for a product launch in India for qualitative and quantitative research, and Arrow Point is the place to go without any doubt!","text_translated":"","published_at":"2026-06-09T20:13:31.839178Z"},{"Name":"Ankush","ProfilePicture":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIY44w0c95_haSwTMiHWip5BcO0yfvJMW7h_iy4cYW5v1SGCg=s120-c-rp-mo-br100","Rating":5,"Description":"We selected Arrow Point as our partner for doing Market Research and Survey quite before few years. We have relied on Mr Athesh and his team for all of our work in those areas ever since. They have also provided us with advice on Consumer Research, Healthcare and Pharmaceutical Research studies to study Feasibility and to assess Need gap for our products in selected markets. They helped us a lot to identify new markets for our products and helped us to make a cake walk market entry for our products and services.  Our engagement with Arrow Point on several projects would be a happy recalling. Thanks to Arrow Point Market Research and Insights Solutions and we call them as ARROW POINT in short!","Images":null,"When":"4 months ago","review_id":"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tWUWNHOXJTMlpUU0VoQ1ptOXhOSFpXTlhad1RFRRAB","source":"Google","rating_scale":5,"rating_float":5,"author_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109543813909291172859/reviews?hl=en-GB","posted_at_unix_micros":1779075755166904,"updated_at_unix_micros":1779075755166904,"language":"en","translated_lang":"","text_original":"We selected Arrow Point as our partner for doing Market Research and Survey quite before few years. We have relied on Mr Athesh and his team for all of our work in those areas ever since. They have also provided us with advice on Consumer Research, Healthcare and Pharmaceutical Research studies to study Feasibility and to assess Need gap for our products in selected markets. They helped us a lot to identify new markets for our products and helped us to make a cake walk market entry for our products and services.  Our engagement with Arrow Point on several projects would be a happy recalling. Thanks to Arrow Point Market Research and Insights Solutions and we call them as ARROW POINT in short!","text_translated":"","published_at":"2026-05-18T03:42:35.166904Z"},{"Name":"kishori bhat","ProfilePicture":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLmOsL3TidbYiWqKkoSA6mMgp55clr6kWA77lz_cs5Wx_oASQ=s120-c-rp-mo-br100","Rating":5,"Description":"Arrow Point India is one of those rare firms that actually customizes the research to your context rather than pulling out a standard template. Their qualitative insights in particular are quite strong. The only consistent feedback I'd give is around pre-onboarding response time - it needs work. Once the project starts though, they are reliable about delivery timelines.","Images":null,"When":"3 months ago","review_id":"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pCRU5VTkVUR1pqYTNOeVlYcFFVM0UxZVU1cFYzYxAB","source":"Google","rating_scale":5,"rating_float":5,"author_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108850150825177190241/reviews?hl=en-GB","posted_at_unix_micros":1782125452561521,"updated_at_unix_micros":1782125452561521,"language":"en","translated_lang":"","text_original":"Arrow Point India is one of those rare firms that actually customizes the research to your context rather than pulling out a standard template. Their qualitative insights in particular are quite strong. The only consistent feedback I'd give is around pre-onboarding response time - it needs work. Once the project starts though, they are reliable about delivery timelines.","text_translated":"","published_at":"2026-06-22T10:50:52.561521Z"}]
